# Aethon Custom DPI Rules (Hot-Reloadable via SIGHUP & Dashboard)
# Format: <action> <proto> <src> <sport> -> <dst> <dport> (msg:"..."; content:"..."; sid:<id>; rev:<rev>;)
#
# Actions:
#   drop / reject : Intercepts and injects TCP RST (or drops UDP) immediately
#   alert         : Logs security event without dropping the connection
#
# Examples (uncomment or manage from Dashboard -> Custom DPI Rules):
# drop tcp any any -> any any (msg:"CUSTOM Block /wp-admin probe"; content:"/wp-admin"; nocase; sid:9000001; rev:1;)
# drop http any any -> any any (msg:"CUSTOM Block curl Scanner"; content:"User-Agent|3a 20|evil-scanner"; nocase; sid:9000002; rev:1;)
# alert tcp any any -> any any (msg:"CUSTOM Audit SQL UNION attempt"; pcre:"/union\s+select/i"; sid:9000003; rev:1;)
